      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's heavy. and i think i know what you mean about the silence. it's almost beautiful in a dark way, isn't it? like the only way to truly be at peace is to just... exit the stage. i've been thinking about this a lot lately. not just for elias, but for myself. sometimes i look at my own life and it feels exactly like his. just this endless, loud noise of trying and failing. part of me thinks writing him this way is the only way i can actually express what i'm feeling right now. that it's okay to just stop fighting. do you think a character—or someone—is allowed to just decide that they've had enough?",
